    {
      "id": "9603b918",
      "type": "hero",
      "media": {
        "kind": "video",
        "project": "zoozoos",
        "type": "header"
      },
      "title": "I explored the space between **chemistry and art** for Eucerin to elevate their brand imagery.",
      "intro": [
        "EUCERIN was looking to elevate the visual language of their mode-of-action for the newest product lineup. Their brand was struggling with being perceived as firmly in the medical niche, so we decided to use digital art to situate them closer to a beauty product while still honoring their scientific background.",
        "To achieve that goal, I led a team of digital artists to create digital sculptures that visualize the main chemical ingredients in a new, aesthetic way. Together we iterated over different ideas and picked the ones that resonated the most with our goal.",
        "The end result was not just a set of assets for their campaign but rather a new approach to positioning their brand."
      ],
      "credit": "Comissioned Work | EUCERIN | 2024/25 | **Creative Direction & Artist**"
    },
